  "source_limits": [
    "Gardner 2021 isolated powder yield 97.26% is limiting-Mg synthesis basis; weak 31P signal could be residual KH2PO4 despite no obvious XRD precursor. EDX n=10 are spots, not batches. Thermal claims deliberately not curated; abstract calls event endothermic whereas Results/DTA call it exothermic, and Figure 8 locator in thermal discussion appears inconsistent.",
    "Abayie 2025 solution concentration removals cannot stand for mineral-specific recovery or complete feed mass balance. Reagent volume change is not corrected in printed equation. Fitted crystalline percentages lack presented residuals/internal standard/amorphous correction/uncertainty; mixture XRD and local EDS are supported narrower claims.",
    "Abayie 2025 nominal grade 97% in Methods/Figure 6 versus 95% in the abstract; sidestream71/70.9 versus Table 1 70.01; nominal ratios/doses not independently reconciled. Second recycled cycle showed no additional K concentration change.",
    "Abayie 2025 Table 4 Cd 2 mg/kg (Model 2) exceeds its own 1.5 mg/kg inorganic fertilizer column despite prose saying all values are below limits. No current law, compliance or safety inference. Related source follow-up proposed separately.",
    "No inoculum/organism/taxon claim in accepted experiments. No criticality list mapping. Pilot filter-press feed preparation and industrial feed origin do not establish precipitation deployment."
  ],
